    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to see how \"building a new self\" is even possible when the foundation is gone. it feels like i've already reached the end of the road. i'm just exhausted from pretending that there's some hidden meaning in continuing like this. everything feels so empty and static. what's even the point of trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
